sequenceDiagram
    actor User
    participant Frontend
    participant API as Core API
    participant DB as Scheduling Database
    participant Queue as Solve Job Queue
    participant Worker as Timetable Solver Worker
    participant Engine as Solver Engine

    User->>Frontend: Request timetable generation
    Frontend->>API: Submit scheduling preferences
    API->>DB: Read canonical scheduling data
    DB-->>API: Events, venues, modules, and access rules
    API->>API: Prepare solver input and create solve job
    API->>Queue: Assign solve job
    API-->>Frontend: Return job reference

    Queue-->>Worker: Deliver assigned job
    Worker->>API: Request prepared solver input
    API-->>Worker: Provide solver input
    Worker->>Engine: Generate timetable
    Engine-->>Worker: Return feasible solution or failure
    Worker->>API: Return solver result and outcome
    API->>DB: Record solution and job status

    loop While generation is running
        Frontend->>API: Check solve status
        API-->>Frontend: Progress or completion
    end
    Frontend-->>User: Display generated timetable
